      "mergeID": "6223f05ef0be0a33b051c9dd",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I want to rotate the angle limit for frozen axis (2D plane) physbones. \nThis would also be nice for non-frozen (3D plane) bones, but as they exist in a 3D plane I struggle to think of a way to do that intuitively. \n\nOptions like \"Max Angle Offset X\", \"Max Angle Offset Z\", and \"Freeze Axis Max Angle Offset\", which would rotate the max angle limits for better tuning would be nice.\n\nIncluded a gif to better explain:",
